{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f3d6006945d280ae3f","chatId":"1d3e5f336b24417ca6b3fb5d7b80a265","sessionId":null,"userId":69524,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":945,"promptTokens":1469,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:59"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035925689808374906,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f3d6006945d280ae3e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369779643,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8f3d6006945d280ae3e","chatId":"1d3e5f336b24417ca6b3fb5d7b80a265","sessionId":null,"userId":69524,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n45岁的萨姆是一位内向的科学家，多年来一直与社交焦虑作斗争。今天，他被邀请在众多受人尊敬的同行面前发表演讲，介绍他最近的前沿发现。但是，他的妻子是唯一出席演讲的人。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，萨姆最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 伤心\nB) 失望\nC) 生气\nD) 绝望\nE) 信任\nF) 惊喜\n\n## 问题 2\n萨姆为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他不用在一大群人面前发表演讲，否则他会很焦虑\nB) 他希望有更多的人来参加\nC) 他期待在大型聚会上发言\nD) 他希望通过发表演讲来克服他的社交焦虑。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035925689808374906,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8f3d6006945d280ae3f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369779640,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"25b6ec9cb57e4b71b6687927b34ce6a1"}